{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And Elazar the priest said</b> — Moses spoke to the commanders of thousands, the passage of purification, and they had no metal vessels in their hands but only valuable garments. But Elazar the priest spoke to the men of the army and saw in their hands vessels of household use found in homes, therefore he instructed them the laws of purging. Or, because the sprinkling was performed through him, therefore he also instructed them the laws of purging:"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:32.517684835Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}